                        "review": "85/100 - I praised the first game a lot and rate it 90/100; this sequel isn't bad, but it doesn't change much from the first game in terms of gameplay, and the campaign is shorter and force you to play with specific characters way more times than the first one!!! I didn't play the online mode for either of them, so I can't say anything about that.\n\nWell, this is the end of a promising saga. Goodbye FREEDOM FORCE, I hope you came back with a MARVEL ULTIMATE ALLIANCE gameplay :,(",
